{"v":4,"catch":"用盤子來處理那些討厭的蟲子！","desc":"“Pettan Pyuu”是SUNSOFT於1984年發行的動作遊戲。控制角色“ Pettan”，並利用這些板擦去蟲子並解決多維迷宮。 您將需要掌握4種不同類型的印版，它們都有各自的特點。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-11-05","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b712534e017fc4f870d8afa94e712cdb408b05a3bc0dcb3c6e42e3a8f8dd3631.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9b85cafcc559ce4a665f8e3bd51085f598f825a9e4d3e377706da8622371b37c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/219d959383e267bc3eced708439755ac8d19166315afc5ba0a5102b1cc038bd8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eab7df36b7c03728707e350cc5848557d082c49cc9d638faf40581958b8e4b2d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e3c361d6af7b178bee822a023022007a00fa705d9fdd785a9067583eb3495e83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d16a44f895b58272e42b86801f4d071e411ac7d60c032d532a68a92ed318978a.jpg"],"titleId":"01007fc011cf0000","dlc":[]}